# Testing Standards

ReachIn has no automated tests. All testing is manual.

## Before Submitting Changes

Test all four navigation cases:

1. **Not on LinkedIn** — opens new tab with search URL
2. **Search page, wrong keywords** — updates search or navigates
3. **LinkedIn, not search page** — navigates to content search
4. **Correct search page** — collects immediately

## Collection Testing

- Verify scrolling and see-more expansion on live LinkedIn
- Test exclude keywords filter
- Test unique email mode (collect twice, verify dedup)
- Test empty results handling
- Test copy to clipboard

## Regression Checklist

- [ ] Popup opens without console errors
- [ ] Theme switching works (light/dark/system)
- [ ] History save, expand, copy, delete
- [ ] Settings persist across popup close/reopen
- [ ] Clear All Data removes all storage
- [ ] Tab switch hides/shows results correctly

## LinkedIn Compatibility

- Test on `linkedin.com/search/results/content` page
- Verify selectors still match after LinkedIn UI changes
- Check content script appears in page DevTools → Sources

## After Content Script Changes

1. Reload extension at `chrome://extensions`
2. Refresh LinkedIn tab
3. Re-run collection test
